<deck name="T-6 Limits" tags='Primary'><fields><rich-text name='Front' sides='11'></rich-text><rich-text name='Back' sides='01'></rich-text></fields><cards><card><rich-text name='Back'>23.5 volts</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Minimum battery voltage for start?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>46 to 50% (Avoid 62–80% Np during stabilized ground ops)</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Np at Idle (ground)?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>90 to 120 psi (oil pressure less than 90 psi at flight idle or above is indicative of a oil system malfunction)</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Oil pressure at Takeoff/Max?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>820°C maximum</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>ITT Max at Takeoff/Max?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>100% maximum (PMU OFF: 100 ± 2%)</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Np at Takeoff/Max?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>150 KIAS</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Maximum airspeed with gear and flaps down (VLE/VFE)?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>104% maximum</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>N1 at Takeoff/Max?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>200 psi maximum</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Oil pressure during Start?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'><p>Limited to -1G at 180° bank angle change</p></rich-text><rich-text name='Front'><p>Uncoordinated rolling maneuvers initiated at __ G shall be limited to a __ degree angle of bank change</p></rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>750°C maximum</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>ITT Max at Idle (ground)?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>40 to 130 psi (permitted only during aerobatics or spins and 15 to 40 psi for 5 seconds with PCL at IDLE)</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Oil pressure during Transient?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>101 to 107% for 5 seconds (with PMU on torque between 102 to 107% is possible following rapid PCL movement or aerobatics maneuvers. Torque above 107% is a limiting system malfunction)</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Torque percentage during Transient?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>30 seconds</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'><p>Do not exceed -2.5 G for longer than __.</p></rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>106 to 110°C for 10 minutes</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Oil temperature during Transient?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>Four 20-second cycles</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Starter cycle limit?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>Approved only for transit through 5000 feet of light rime ice</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Aircraft icing certification?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>60 to 61%</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>N1 at Idle (ground)?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>10 to 105°C</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Oil temperature at Takeoff/Max?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>0.67 Mach</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Maximum operating Mach number (MMO)?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>2 minutes</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Cooling period after second starter cycle?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>60 seconds</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Max time for inverted flight?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>104% maximum</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>N1 during Transient?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>10 knots</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Max crosswind for wet runway?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>25 knots</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Max crosswind for dry runway?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>10 to 105°C</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Oil temperature at Idle (flight)?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>+4.7 to -1.0 Gs</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Asymmetric G limits (clean configuration)?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>871 to 1000°C for 5 seconds</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>ITT Max during Start?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>5 knots</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Max crosswind for icy runway?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>+2.5 to 0.0 Gs</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Symmetric G limits (gear/flaps extended)?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>+7.0 to -3.5 Gs</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Symmetric G limits (clean configuration)?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>5 seconds</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Max time for intentional zero G flight?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>821 to 870°C for 20 seconds</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>ITT Max during Transient?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>316 KIAS</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Maximum operating airspeed (VMO)?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>3.6 ± 0.2 PSI</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Cockpit pressurization schedule limit?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>60 seconds</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Max time for negative G operations?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>799 PPH or less</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Maximum fuel flow?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>-40°C minimum</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Oil temperature during Start?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>-40 to 105°C (106 to 110 is acceptable at or below 20% torque)</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Oil temperature at Idle (ground)?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>1 to 10% (allowable range with Np stabilized and PCL at idle)</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Torque percentage at Idle (ground)?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>110% maximum for 20 seconds (permissible at any operating condition "power setting" for completion of an in-flight emergency)</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Np during Transient?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'><p>(11) prohibited maneuvers</p>
<ul>
<li>Inverted stalls</li>
<li>inverted spins</li>
<li>spins with PCL above idle</li>
<li>spins with landing gear flaps or speed brake extended</li>
<li>spins with PMU off</li>
<li>aggravated spins past two turns</li>
<li>spins below 10k ft PA</li>
<li>spins above 22k ft PA</li>
<li>abrupt cross-controlled (snap) maneuvers</li>
<li>aerobatic maneuvers spins or stalls with a fuel imbalance greater than 50lbs between wings</li>
<li>tail slides<br/></li>
</ul></rich-text><rich-text name='Front'><p>Prohibited manuevers<br/><br/><strong data-start="660" data-end="666">(I</strong>nverted <strong data-start="674" data-end="679">I</strong>diots <strong data-start="685" data-end="690">S</strong>pin <strong data-start="694" data-end="699">S</strong>loppy, <strong data-start="706" data-end="711">S</strong>low, <strong data-start="716" data-end="721">A</strong>larming <strong data-start="729" data-end="734">S</strong>pirals, <strong data-start="742" data-end="747">S</strong>eeking <strong data-start="754" data-end="759">A</strong>lmost <strong data-start="765" data-end="770">A</strong>ssured <strong data-start="777" data-end="782">T</strong>rauma)</p></rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>+2.0 to 0.0 Gs</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Asymmetric G limits (gear/flaps extended)?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>100% (PMU governs to 100 ± 2%, torque above 102% at a constant PCL setting and steady flight indicates a governing system malfunction)</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Torque percentage at Takeoff/Max?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>22.0 volts</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Minimum battery voltage (general)?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>Below 1800 PSI or above 3500 PSI</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Hydraulic caution range?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>30 seconds</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Cooling period after first starter cycle?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>5 minutes</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Cooling period after third starter cycle?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>67% minimum</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>N1 at Idle (flight)?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>60 seconds minimum</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'><p>Minimum time of positive G's before additional negative G's</p></rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>Below 110 pounds in respective wing tank</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'><p>Fuel quantity to trigger caution light activation?</p></rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>30 minutes</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Cooling period after fourth starter cycle?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>10 knots</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Max tailwind component for takeoff?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>90 psi minimum</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Oil pressure at Idle?</rich-text></card><card><rich-text name='Back'>207 KIAS</rich-text><rich-text name='Front'>Maximum turbulent air penetration speed?</rich-text></card></cards></deck>